-- No migration. schema_version stays 5. If the Developer finds rescue_missing_logistics needs an index to stay fast once it scans all live patient records, the only acceptable addition is CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_records_patient_seq ON records(patient_id, seq); -- rationale: rescue now scans per-patient non-tombstoned rows ordered by seq; without (patient_id, seq) the scan degrades to a full table fetch on long episodes.